  "tier_rules": {
    "1": "Stems of four or five words. The helping verb is is, am, are, can, or will. Distractors are a noun and the main verb.",
    "2": "Stems of five to seven words. Use was, were, has, have, did, or should. Include the main verb and a pronoun or person as misses.",
    "3": "Near-miss stems. Use might, could, would, must, or has/have plus a past form. The closest wrong choice is a verb-looking main verb."
  },
